    "The 'Get Contents of URL' action, for Shortcuts automations" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「URL の内容を取得」アクションで鳴らす"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This value is shown only once. Save it into your service before closing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この値を見られるのは今だけです。外部サービスに設定してから閉じてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To ring only when a command fails, keep its exit status in a variable and exit with it after sending the alarm, so CI still sees the failure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失敗時だけ鳴らす時は終了ステータスを変数に取り、アラーム送信後にその値で exit します (CI が失敗を検知できるように)"
